#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Local HTTP gateway for the file-backed coding workflow agent.

The server intentionally owns no workflow state.  It reads the agent's
atomically-written state files and appends user input to a per-run inbox; the
workflow worker remains the only process that mutates ``state.json``.
"""

